liveboard:
  name: agentGenerated_West Region Total Sales Analysis
  visualizations:
  - id: Viz_1
    viz_guid: bbccb894-56c2-41f0-afa1-4c788011d584
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • Tables and Machines sub-categories generating -$6,062 in combined losses despite $97,807 in sales
        • Three states (NC, TN, FL) operating at -$16,231 combined loss, with NC at -13.5% margin
        • Top 5 worst products account for -$11,802 losses, mostly high-ticket items like 3D printers and conference tables
        • South region has lowest total sales at $391K vs $725K for top-performing West region

        Recommendations:
        • Discontinue or reprice loss-making Tables and Machines products, focus on break-even analysis
        • Implement state-specific profit recovery plans for NC, TN, and FL markets
        • Review pricing strategy for high-ticket items generating largest losses
